  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Property includes dedicated Rosemary Beach® community Beach Access via 9 Private Beach Walkovers. Beach chair service available for an additional cost through RBPOA Beach Service. Complimentary access to Rosemary Beach® Fitness and complimentary court time at Rosemary Beach® Racquet Club also included.<br><br>Bienvenidos a Casa Blanco! This remarkable seven bedroom luxury home is a coastal destination your family will never forget! The towering 5,000+ square foot home greets you with a grand front entrance and delightful fountain facing the butterfly garden. Upon entering the courtyard, you will be amazed by the sprawling pool and entertaining space. An outdoor sectional and covered outdoor dining space are just the beginning of this wonderful space. Enter the lower level of the home to find a luxury chef's kitchen, large open living space with fireplace, an oversized dining table for 10 guests, and lots of bar seating for other members of your family and friends.<br><br>The first bedroom is a luxurious king master bedroom with lounge seating and a private en-suite bath that includes double vanities, a soaking tub, and walk-in shower. As you climb the stairs to the second level, enjoy views of unique architectural elements and decor of this stylish new construction home. A second lounge area greets you at the top of the stairs on the second floor with a sofa, flatscreen TV, and balcony overlooking Kingston Road. Down the hall, this home features a large family suite bedroom with a king bed, tucked-away bunk bed, and private bathroom. This bathroom is conveniently equipped with double vanities and a walk-in shower for the family to share. On the opposite side of the second level, there are two additional king junior master suites that are also equipped with private and upgraded en-suite bathrooms. The bunk room on this floor gives extra space for all of the children in your group with 2 bunk beds that sleep a total of 4 guests. Guests staying in this room will find a convenient bathroom located right outside of the bedroom door. <br><br>The top level of this home offers beautiful birds eye views of the community, a second family suite with king bed and two built-in twin beds, a private bathroom, and third lounging area with television. <br><br>Driveway parking for two vehicles. <br><br>This property requires a 7 night minimum stay, Saturday to Saturday during spring break and summer and a 4 night minimum stay during shoulder season. <br><br>**Home is currently for sale and may require a showing during your stay, with a 24-hour notice. <br><br>STR2024-056482",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
